<a class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary dark:text-secondary-fixed-dim border-secondary" href="#">Features</a>
<a class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant dark:text-outline hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">How it Works</a>
<a class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant dark:text-outline hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">Technology</a>
<a class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant dark:text-outline hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">Dashboard</a>
</div>
