        </button>
</div>
</nav>
<main class="overflow-x-hidden">
<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="relative px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-stack-lg min-h-screen flex items-center" style="padding-top: calc(var(--spacing-stack-lg, 48px) + 18px);">
<div class="absolute inset-0 water-flow-pattern -z-10"></div>
<div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-stack-lg items-center w-full">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-6 max-w-[736px] w-[115%]" data-aos="fade-right">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1 bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container rounded-full w-fit">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">eco</span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps">Next-Gen Plant Care</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl md:text-6xl text-gradient leading-tight mt-4" style="line-height: 1.125; display: block; padding-top: 0.5rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">Precision PlantCare.<br>Powered by Gravity.</h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-lg mt-8">
                    The IoT system that understands your plants' thirst through weight-based signatures. Automated, manual, or vacation mode — always water enough.
                </p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-4">
<button class="bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps px-8 py-4 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all hover:translate-y-[-2px] flex items-center gap-2">
                        Get Started <span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_forward</span>
</button>
<button class="bg-surface border border-outline text-on-surface font-label-caps text-label-caps px-8 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                        Watch Demo <span class="material-symbols-outlined">play_circle</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="relative group w-full" data-aos="fade-left">
<div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-tr from-secondary-container/30 to-primary-fixed/30 blur-2xl rounded-[40px] -z-10 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"></div>
<img alt="Plant on Aqua Weight Smart Base" class="w-[90%] ml-auto h-auto rounded-[32px] shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-outline-variant/30 object-cover block" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLs2HnNoCUuJZPoXUTOejH5Efhn2bhAFwQ7c_qQ2NX8F8O9RrNzP1wjn96Au9V_hE3oThQRjBhX4JaGHhWmPs81g_bB3XvC_qwzu3v6Wns3sWIEjFUJHO5qi5QjEsivpPQEb-O7rHHZLNkuYtjWIlTgHPdAhimp73Sw2h_1QtKOSv_kTMRLhNeUPd00K_s1_TYyA7MIvd9pAFXFDKxgmvLBanQNrBKIaTWJ6vVSs3dcYcnIFRJiZucaGcEJf">
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Smart Watering Section (Features) -->
<section class="bg-surface-container-low px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-stack-lg">
<div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">
<div class="text-center mb-16">
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface mb-4">Smart Watering for Every Scenario.</h2>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto">Choose the mode that fits your lifestyle. Our intelligent gravity-sensing base handles the rest.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-gutter">
<!-- Card 1: Automatic -->
<div class="glass-card p-8 rounded-[24px] flex flex-col gap-4 group hover:border-secondary/50 transition-colors" style="transform: translateY(0px); transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);">
<div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-secondary group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl" style="font-variation-settings: &quot;FILL&quot; 1;">auto_mode</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">Automatic</h3>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant">Sensor-driven intelligence.</p><div><br><div><i>Be reminded of watering exactly when needed by each plant individually. Our algorithms detect precise moisture evaporation through weight loss.</i></div></div><p class=""></p>
<div class="mt-auto pt-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-secondary-container bg-secondary-container/50 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">notifications</span><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm">Push Alerts</span></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="w-full bg-outline-variant/20 h-1 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><div class="bg-secondary h-full w-[99%]"></div></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary mt-2 inline-block">99% Accuracy Gain 24/7</span></div></div>
</div>
<!-- Card 2: Manual -->
<div class="glass-card p-8 rounded-[24px] flex flex-col gap-4 group hover:border-secondary/50 transition-colors" style="transform: translateY(0px); transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);">
<div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-secondary group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl" style="font-variation-settings: &quot;FILL&quot; 1;">touch_app</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">Manual</h3>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant">Take full control at convenient time.</p><div><br><div><i>Get immediate real-time watering suggestion&nbsp;specific to each plant as soon as its weight is entered manually by owner or a helping person.</i></div></div><p class=""></p>
<div class="mt-auto pt-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-secondary-container bg-secondary-container/50 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">list_alt</span><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm">Live Logs</span></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="w-full bg-outline-variant/20 h-1 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><div class="bg-secondary h-full w-[99%]"></div></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary mt-2 inline-block">99% Accuracy Gain ad-hoc</span></div></div>
</div>
<!-- Card 3: Vacation -->
<div class="glass-card p-8 rounded-[24px] flex flex-col gap-4 group hover:border-secondary/50 transition-colors" style="transform: translateY(0px); transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);">
<div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-secondary group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl" style="font-variation-settings: &quot;FILL&quot; 1;">flight_takeoff</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">Vacation</h3>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant">Worry-free growth with smart projections.</p><div><br></div><div><i>Receive gentle nudges on your phone exactly when the pot reaches the 'thirst' threshold&nbsp;based on historical weight-to-moisture patterns.</i></div><p class=""></p>
<div class="mt-auto pt-6">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-secondary-container bg-secondary-container/50 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">check_circle</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm">Smart Projected Care Active</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-4"><div class="w-full bg-outline-variant/20 h-1 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><div class="bg-secondary h-full w-[77%]"></div></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary mt-2 inline-block">77% Accuracy Projection</span></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Core Stack Section (Technology) -->
<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-stack-lg bg-surface">
<div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">
<div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-stack-lg items-center">
<div class="relative order-2 lg:order-1">
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container flex flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center border border-outline-variant/30">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary">bolt</span>
<span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md">FastAPI</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Performant Backend</span>
</div>
<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-high flex flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center border border-outline-variant/30 transform">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary">layers</span>
<span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md">React</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Reactive Dashboard</span>
</div>
<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-high flex flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center border border-outline-variant/30">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary">database</span>
<span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md">MariaDB</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Secure Data Persistence</span>
</div>
<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container flex flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center border border-outline-variant/30 transform">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary">router</span>
<span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md">Nginx</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Robust Reverse Proxy</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:pl-12 order-1 lg:order-2">
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Built for Reliability.</h2>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">Our core stack is designed for low latency and high availability. From the sensor to your screen, every byte of weight data is processed with extreme precision and industrial-grade stability.</p>
<ul class="space-y-4 mt-4">
<li class="flex items-center gap-3">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-sm">check</span>
</div>
<span class="text-on-surface">Real-time WebSocket updates</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-3">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-sm">check</span>
</div>
<span class="text-on-surface">Asynchronous task management</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-3">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-sm">check</span>
</div>
<span class="text-on-surface">Scalable microservices architecture</span>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Unified Security & Privacy Section -->
<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-stack-lg bg-navy-navy text-surface overflow-hidden relative">
<!-- Background Shield Graphic -->
<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-10 flex items-center justify-center -z-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[600px] text-secondary" style="font-variation-settings: &quot;FILL&quot; 0, &quot;wght&quot; 100;">shield_with_heart</span>
</div>
<div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto relative z-10">
<div class="text-center mb-16">
<h2 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-white mb-4">Security &amp; Privacy</h2>
<p class="text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Industry-grade safeguards protecting your growth, data, and identity.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-gutter gap-y-16">
<!-- 1. Privacy by Design -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-6 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-secondary/30 transition-colors">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<h3 class="font-headline-lg text-white">Privacy by Design</h3>
<p class="font-label-caps text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider text-sm font-semibold">Your privacy is our priority.</p>
</div>
<p class="text-slate-300 font-body-md leading-relaxed">
                        Your identity remains fully anonymous. We implement robust security measures to ensure your plant care data remains yours alone, utilizing industry-standard encryption and privacy-first account management.
                    </p>
<div class="mt-auto pt-6 flex items-start gap-4 border-t">
<img alt="Null User Data Icon" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain rounded-lg" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAYOAbfvnAXibPX0jDr6FMkruOomyZidMOSmB2YsvxjyDmjTFQuUc0fyoX5qdaXEmBKXYgfTigTE1kXlezxgPAxM3F9FGa-lVoIZ7yTBbFK8KiNMC3s14WpV69R7w8Z_SLP7Eyh-5h0Iy25qS1bntn1MrCZ-aJT5e3wuz_uuSpsOZ96L6ICueA7xWvzhC6K4EwFct6PnzC67ltFmefO7IJbGQmDnmSX8IAv9iyMGKOIcEOrqTdDgOiW4mf4hohy_zD-kupVblqh3f4V">
<div>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps block mb-1 text-white">Null User Data</span>
<p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Account creation requires only a username and password. Providing an email address is entirely optional.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- 2. Protection by Principle -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-6 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-secondary/30 transition-colors">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<h3 class="font-headline-lg text-white">Protection by Principle</h3>
<p class="font-label-caps text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider text-sm font-semibold">Foundational data-minimization rules.</p>
</div>
<p class="text-slate-300 font-body-md leading-relaxed">
                        Our system is built on a foundation of proactive data protection and user-centric privacy principles. We prioritize minimal data collection to maximize your digital safety.
                    </p>
<div class="mt-auto pt-6 flex items-start gap-4 border-t">
<img alt="Zero Device Info Icon" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain rounded-lg" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLvYbkPMv-OJEH18LSN-NwcBc0hcw_rliXT7ini9d2icufDSLpgJv6vGwWIiu4devR8tFWiAaOlThR16JQLLmHetNWj5J9kHHxbsu6Exd_seCZ8nxq2NWFDbD0MaEVOcRf9EKhU-SCY8-QnMJT3ri8fWVayBXWbtOfIGJduMPeW5_aWGQnDe_KcMV-f-_iO3WiwTGWT8DLVhCpDG3h6nH1m48GnhDEx_5D3AzeYGyoqJL1YGnS5Yzl3ij2A">
<div>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps block mb-1 text-white">Zero Device Info</span>
<p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Only if you choose to trust specific device for a faster login experience would device fingerprint be saved.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- 3. Security by Engineering -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-6 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-secondary/30 transition-colors">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<h3 class="font-headline-lg text-white">Security by Engineering</h3>
<p class="font-label-caps text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider text-sm font-semibold">Fortifying integrity with industrial-grade safeguards.</p>
</div>
<p class="text-slate-300 font-body-md leading-relaxed">
                        Best industry-grade LLMs perform regular automated penetration tests to ensure the highest standards of system resilience and data safety are maintained against evolving threats.
                    </p>
<div class="mt-auto pt-6 flex items-start gap-4 border-t">
<img alt="MFA Icon" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLv-4kxTbJ7NACZ50eINrVqfgbIDxSuN4LC7FdWLxT8kMGdsYf0fjBQ9shTNJAJPfIScFnhj9GC1kN2jbUkdetyCGk-UKGhm4FLR3-5JT_Uoywyu1gnp8miF5FUEfaIsLpBSIkDEDCyaNJOrAcF1mWFR8qC0LdPfA6s_dMgiUMl6x4csaWc60s6wh2CzmiD4VVzCtHzK22X1_GWhAUyyrHwDRTdWotTWh1haUbG6zg3j0JnzuhztVBX-oH0v">
<div>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps block mb-1 text-white">Multi-Factor Authentication</span>
<p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Ensure that only you can access your account by requiring an MFA verification step via secure standards.</p>
</div>
</div>
